]].`,`vn`:`Em trai c\u1ee7a m\u1eb9 s\u1ed1ng xa l\u1eafm, t\u1eadn ven bi\u1ec3n. C\u1eadu \u1ea5y \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 b\u1ea1n g\u00e1i. \`B\u1ea1n g\u00e1i c\u1ee7a c\u1eadu c\u0169ng \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng \u00f4ng?\` Ng\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi. \`T\u1ea5t nhi\u00ean r\u1ed3i,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i. \`C\u1ea3 b\u1ea1n trai c\u1ee7a c\u00e1i H\u1ed3ng n\u1eefa.\` \`\u00d4ng \u01a1i! Ch\u1ecb H\u1ed3ng c\u00f3 ch\u1ed3ng r\u1ed3i, \u0111\u00e2u c\u00f2n b\u1ea1n trai!\` \u00d4ng b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \u00d4ng qu\u00ean k\u00ednh, m\u00e0 qu\u00ean lu\u00f4n c\u1ea3 ch\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ta.`},{`en`:`[[Then]] [[there]] [[is|be]] Mr Nghia, [[their]] [[neighbour]] [[at]] [[number]] 24. [[He]] [[has|have]] [[a]] [[photo]] [[shop]], [[and]] [[he]] [[is|be]] Grandpa's [[old]] [[friend]]. \`[[Our]] [[neighbour]] [[takes|take]] [[the]] [[photo]], [[and]] [[you]] [[help]] [[him]],\` [[says|say]] Grandpa.`,`vn`:`R\u1ed3i c\u00f2n \u00f4ng Ngh\u0129a, h\u00e0ng x\u00f3m \u1edf s\u1ed1 24. \u00d4ng c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t ti\u1ec7m \u1ea3nh, v\u00e0 l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n l\u00e2u n\u0103m c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng T\u00e2m. \`\u00d4ng h\u00e0ng x\u00f3m ch\u1ee5p, c\u00f2n ch\u00e1u ph\u1ee5 \u00f4ng \u1ea5y,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i.`},{`en`:`[[Now]] [[there]] [[are|be]] [[twenty]] [[people]] [[on]] [[the]] [[list]]. Grandpa [[writes|write]] [[one]] [[more]] [[name]] [[at]] [[the]] [[end]]: Son. \`[[Who]] [[is|be]] Son?\` [[asks|ask]] Ngoc. Grandpa [[looks|look]] [[at]] [[the]] [[name]] [[for]] [[a]] [[long]] [[time]]. \`[[My]] [[other]] [[son]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[Your]] [[uncle]], [[your]] [[dad's|dad]] [[brother]].\` Ngoc [[looks|look]] [[up]]. [[Dad]] [[is|be]] [[at]] [[the]] [[door]]. [[He]] [[turns|turn]] [[and]] [[walks|walk]] [[away]].`,`vn`:`Gi\u1edd danh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 hai m\u01b0\u01a1i ng\u01b0\u1eddi. \u00d4ng vi\u1ebft th\u00eam m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i t\u00ean \u1edf cu\u1ed1i: S\u01a1n. \`S\u01a1n l\u00e0 ai \u1ea1?\` Ng\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi